<title>HONG KONG: Freddie Mac to launch $750 mln global bond.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to launch $750 mln global bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp (Freddie Mac) will launch a US$750 million global bond during London hours on Wednesday, joint lead manager Goldman Sachs said.</p>
<p>JP Morgan is the other joint lead manager.</p>
<p>The 10-year bond will be priced during New York hours to yield 22 basis points over comparable U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>The settlement date is April 10.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6371</p>
